# 🐸 Platformer Game

A 2D platformer game built with **Vanilla JavaScript** and **HTML5 Canvas** — no frameworks, no libraries.

![Game Preview](src/assets/tampilan/image.png)

## 🎮 Play Now
👉 **[Live Demo](https://dharmayudho22.github.io/Platforner_web_game/)** — Play directly in browser!

---

## 🕹️ How to Play

| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `W` / `Arrow Up` | Jump (double jump supported!) |
| `A` / `Arrow Left` | Move Left |
| `D` / `Arrow Right` | Move Right |
| `Enter` / `Space` | Start / Next Level |
| `R` | Restart after Game Over |

**Tips:**
- 🦵 **Stomp enemies** by jumping on top of them — +100 score each!
- ⚠️ Avoid **spikes** and **rotating saws**
- 🏆 Clear all enemies to advance to the next level
- ❤️ You have **3 HP** — take damage carefully

---

## ✨ Features

- **2 Levels** with increasing difficulty
- **Moving platforms** — horizontal & vertical
- **Enemy patrol AI** with stomp mechanic
- **Traps** — spikes and rotating saws
- **Double jump**
- **Camera system** that follows the player
- **HP system** with invincibility frames
- **Score system** with level clear bonus
- **Game states** — Menu, Playing, Level Clear, Game Over, Win

---

## 🗂️ Project Structure

```
PLATFORMER/
├── index.html
├── src/
│   ├── assets/
│   │   ├── background/     # Background images
│   │   ├── player/         # Player sprites (32x32)
│   │   ├── musuh/          # Enemy sprites (32x32)
│   │   ├── terrain/        # Terrain spritesheet
│   │   ├── Tiles/          # Kenney tile assets
│   │   └── Traps/          # Trap assets (Spikes, Saw, etc.)
│   ├── js/
│   │   ├── classes/
│   │   │   ├── Player.js       # Player movement, animation, HP
│   │   │   ├── Musuh.js        # Enemy patrol AI
│   │   │   ├── Ground.js       # Background + tile rendering
│   │   │   ├── Camera.js       # Camera follow system
│   │   │   ├── Collision.js    # AABB collision detection
│   │   │   ├── Dekorasi.js     # Decorative elements
│   │   │   └── Traps.js        # Spike, Saw, Moving Platform
│   │   ├── constant.js         # Global constants (canvas size, level width)
│   │   └── index.js            # Game loop, level data, input handling
│   └── style/
│       └── global.css
```

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Vanilla JavaScript** (ES6+)
- **HTML5 Canvas API**
- **No external libraries or frameworks**
- Sprite-based animation system
- AABB collision detection

---

## 🚀 Run Locally

```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/dharmayudho22/Platforner_web_game.git

# Buka dengan Live Server (VS Code extension)
# atau langsung buka index.html di browser
```

> ⚠️ Harus dijalankan via server (Live Server / localhost) karena menggunakan asset loading. Tidak bisa dibuka langsung sebagai file lokal.

---

## 🎨 Assets

- **Characters & Enemies** — Custom pixel art sprites
- **Tiles & Terrain** — [Kenney Tiny Town](https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-town) (CC0)
- **Traps** — Free platformer trap assets

